description: Agent chat prompts and results are logged automatically by user-level hooks (do not duplicate manually).
alwaysApply: true
---

# History (automatic)

Hooks log every chat prompt and result under `~/.agents/history/` (the `~/.cursor`, `~/.claude`, `~/.codex` `history` dirs symlink there). **Do not** create `*_prompt.md` or `*_result.md` unless the user asks for a manual export or fix. Hook failures: `~/.agents/history/.state/hook-errors.log`.
